  "notes": [
    "CORRECTION: the demo card attributed 'no guaranteed returns' to RBI. No plain RBI ban was found; the closest RBI provisions (Commercial Banks RBC Second Amendment 4(20A)(ii), 85N(10)) take effect on 1 Jan 2027 (agent-reported). The firm anchor read here is SEBI's.",
    "Applies to SEBI-regulated intermediaries only. IRDAI (illustration rules) and RBI need their own cards: do not stretch this one.",
    "The Intermediaries Regulations Chapter IIID incl. Reg 16O is footnoted 'w.e.f. 08.04.2027' as printed, so this card cites the master circular, which is in force.",
